  (text "GUID 8c0f2d7a-9934-50b1-a59d-aba02fab321b = Микитич Михайло Васильович\nU1..U5: group length = side (mm) = number of pins; pin name = GUID character.\nPins with the same character are connected (net N_<char>). Characters that occur once are free pins,\nrouted to edge connector J1 on the short side of the board (nets FREE_<char>)." (at 25.4 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9a2e4654-0115-5b0b-a223-0164cb04413b))
